      "comment": "CAWBOURNE LADY (1) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 6 length win at this track in a handy 30.15. Well suited by the inside box and goes well at this distance. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Can continue on her winning ways. MAKING GEMS (8) hit the frame last time at this track but just a few starts ago ran blistering time when scoring over 525m at this track in 30.24. Should be in this for a long way. LET'S GO LEGEND (2) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only a nose (18.36) behind Stew Bob at this track. Expecting another good run. HAVOC TWO (7) warrants respect with the drop in trip.",
